AICE-CHANGE: the application bar's Discord button is not shown;
AICE-CHANGE: the Home screen's Community section and the About dialog's Discord/website/GitHub links are gone;
AICE-CHANGE: the Help (and application) menu has no Discord, website and GitHub items.

Alkalmazás:  git -C <vectorcraft> apply 0001-aice-branding.patch   (vagy: patch -d <vectorcraft> -p1)

